    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/5b352e4c4fa904e099f99a35304db8f9.poster.avif?t=1754755150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/5b352e4c4fa904e099f99a35304db8f9.apng?t=1754755150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Incredible things coming out of Latin America right now&quot; - kenkaioh (NRZGAMES)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/e1eedcc8e52180247cde07c39765016d.poster.avif?t=1754755150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/e1eedcc8e52180247cde07c39765016d.apng?t=1754755150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/a2ad12607709f224f6ebf60cd0820175.poster.avif?t=1754755150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/a2ad12607709f224f6ebf60cd0820175.apng?t=1754755150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=128 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>CURSOR BLAST</u></i></strong> is a SPACE SHOOTER in the style of old school SHMUPs with spaceships, heavily inspired by those from the Nintendo and Super Nintendo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT'S A TRIBUTE TO THE GAMES OF THE 90'S, TO THE <span class=\"bb_strike\">BOOTLEG</span> GAMES OF THE 90'S, WHERE ONE GAME WAS RELEASED AND A THOUSANDS OF SIMILAR GAMES CAME WITH IT.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>to infinity and beyond</strong>, want to play <u><i>5 minutes</i></u>? <i><strong>Make yourself comfortable</strong></i>. Want to play <u><i>60 hours in a row</i></u>? <i><strong>Feel free</strong></i> too, <span class=\"bb_strike\">if you can stay alive</span> with your ship by then.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU ARE A SPACE SHOOTER THAT, IN ORDER TO SURVIVE HUGE HOARDS OF ENEMIES, <u>NEEDS TO SHOOT AND AIM WITH THE MOUSE INSTEAD OF STRAIGHT SHOTS</u>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR <strong>COMFORT</strong> OF JUST PASSING IN FRONT OF THEM TO HIT THEM IS OVER, YOU'RE DRIVING, SO YOU AIM TO HIT THE ENEMIES.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/5c6645ec0aa315352d4ab102ef168676.poster.avif?t=1754755150\" width=690 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/5c6645ec0aa315352d4ab102ef168676.webm?t=1754755150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/5c6645ec0aa315352d4ab102ef168676.mp4?t=1754755150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your stylish movement skills to stay mobile and avoid the relentless attacks of the most varied enemies.\u00a0<strong><i><u>Aim with your mouse</u></i></strong> and take advantage of the <i><u>non-linear aiming</u></i>!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALL GAME IMPROVEMENTS ARE CHOSEN BY CARDS AFTER THE END OF A WORD.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/db36495457d328e43defc1ac216c3024.poster.avif?t=1754755150\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691030/extras/db36495457d328e43defc1ac216c3024.apng?t=1754755150\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=128 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > INFINITE STAGES PASSING THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE <i><u>GALACTIC STATE</u></i>, <strong><i><u><span class=\"bb_strike\">HELL IS HEAVEN</span> COMPARED TO QUANTITY!</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIVE AS LONG AS YOU CAN! CARDS HAVE RARITY! POSSIBLE NEW POST-LAUNCH MODES PLANNED ACCORDING TO NEXT UPDATES;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EAT A <strong>BIG STEAK AND DRINK\u00a0 SUGAR CANE JUICE</strong> WHILE PLAYING THIS <strong><i><u>WONDER!</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY THE GAME WITH ALL YOU CAN, WHO KNOWS YOU MAY GET THE <strong>PLATINUM </strong>ONE DAY, WHO KNOWS!</p></li></ul>",
